{{!
    @template format_dari/report_page

    The per-course Ask Dari report: page heading, tab strip and the active tab.

    The tab strip is a <nav> of ordinary links rather than a JavaScript tab widget, because each
    tab is a separate server-rendered view with its own URL. The active link carries
    aria-current="page".

    Heading levels: Moodle's page header already emits the <h1> (the course full name), so the
    report title here is an <h2>, each region inside a tab is an <h3> and each card title an <h4>.
    There is exactly one <h1> on the page and no level is skipped.

    Classes required for JS:
    * None.

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * None.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * title string Page heading, from the language pack.
    * tabslabel string Accessible name of the tab strip navigation landmark.
    * tabs array Tab links.
      * label string Visible tab label.
      * url string Target URL, already through moodle_url::out().
      * active bool True for the tab currently being shown.
    * iscontent bool True when the course content tab is active.
    * ishistory bool True when the chat history tab is active.
    * contenttab object|null Context for format_dari/report_content_tab, or null.
    * historytab object|null Context for format_dari/report_history_tab, or null.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "title": "Ask Dari Report",
        "tabslabel": "Ask Dari report sections",
        "tabs": [
            {"label": "Course Content", "url": "#content", "active": true},
            {"label": "Chat History", "url": "#history", "active": false}
        ],
        "iscontent": true,
        "ishistory": false,
        "contenttab": {
            "sectioncount": 4,
            "activitycount": 12,
            "charactercount": "18,204",
            "hascoursesummary": true,
            "coursesummary": "<p>An introduction to astrophysics.</p>",
            "hasactivities": true,
            "activities": [
                {
                    "name": "Welcome page",
                    "type": "page",
                    "icon": "<i class=\"icon fa fa-file\"></i>",
                    "haspreview": true,
                    "preview": "Start here before the first seminar."
                }
            ]
        },
        "historytab": null
    }
}}
<div class="dari-report-container">
    <div class="dari-report-header">
        <h2 class="dari-report-title d-flex align-items-center">
            <svg class="mr-2" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="butt" stroke-linejoin="round" width="28" height="28"><path d="M5.25 4.25h13.5a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v8.75a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H11.5l-4.75 3.5v-3.5h-1.5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6.25a2 2 0 0 1 2-2z" fill="currentColor" fill-opacity=".16"/><path d="M12 6.75c.3 2.05 1.2 2.95 3.25 3.25-2.05.3-2.95 1.2-3.25 3.25-.3-2.05-1.2-2.95-3.25-3.25 2.05-.3 2.95-1.2 3.25-3.25z" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/></svg>
            <span>{{title}}</span>
        </h2>
    </div>

    <nav class="dari-tabs" aria-label="{{tabslabel}}">
        {{#tabs}}
        <a href="{{url}}" class="dari-tab{{#active}} active{{/active}}"{{#active}} aria-current="page"{{/active}}>{{label}}</a>
        {{/tabs}}
    </nav>

    {{#contenttab}}
    {{> format_dari/report_content_tab }}
    {{/contenttab}}
    {{#historytab}}
    {{> format_dari/report_history_tab }}
    {{/historytab}}
</div>
